OL,6,     FA lively mix of music to start the
OL,7,     Fday. Perfect for your pod!
OL,8,G0631 The Welsh Roots of Country
OL,9,     FWhen Al Lewis travelled to
OL,10,     FNashville in 2012 to record an
OL,11,     Falbum, he discovered that the
OL,12,     FWelsh have played a far greater
OL,13,     Frole in shaping country and
OL,14,     FAmericana music than many realise.
